# NOTE: clasp matches these patterns relative to rootDir (src/), NOT the
# project root. `rootDir` already scopes the push to src/, so docs, tests and
# scripts are excluded by virtue of living outside it — nothing to do here.
#
# A rule like `!src/**` looks right and silently matches nothing, because the
# paths clasp compares are `Config.js`, not `src/Config.js`. The symptom is
# `clasp push` reporting "Script is already up to date" against an empty editor.
**/*.test.js
